@host = http://localhost:5007

### 1. Add an item to a checkout session
POST {{host}}/sessions/demo/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "sku-1", "quantity": 2 }

### 2. Read the session summary
GET {{host}}/sessions/demo/summary

### 3. Restock a SKU
POST {{host}}/inventory/sku-1/adjust
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 10, "reason": "restock" }

### 4. Read stock on hand
GET {{host}}/inventory/sku-1
